{%- comment -%}
  COMPONENT: Product Short Description (block: `bah-product-short-des`)
  PURPOSE:
    Renders a short blurb under the product title. Reads data from a PRODUCT METAFIELD,
    with block settings as fallback.

  DATA SOURCES (priority, highest first):
    1) product.metafields.custom.product_short_description  → Metaobject reference (preferred)
       - Either:
         A) The metaobject has a "settings" (JSON string) field containing:
            {
              "is_show": true,
              "description": "Your short description text"
            }
         B) OR the metaobject has typed fields:
            - is_show (boolean)
            - description (single-line or multi-line text)
       NOTE: This snippet currently expects the JSON-in-metaobject pattern (A).
             If you use typed fields instead, change reads to:
               is_show      = short_description_mo.is_show.value
               description  = short_description_mo.description.value
    2) Block settings (fallbacks)
       - is_show (checkbox)
       - description (text)

  WHAT TO CREATE IN SHOPIFY (Admin):
    A) Metaobject definition (recommended name): "product_short_description"
       • Field: "settings" (Type: Single line text or JSON)  ← put JSON here
         Example JSON value:
         {"is_show":true,"description":"Cozy, durable, and pet-safe materials your buddy will love."}
       (If you prefer typed fields instead of JSON, add two fields:
         is_show:boolean, description:text — and see NOTE above.)
    B) Product metafield:
       • Namespace & key: custom.product_short_description
       • Type: Metaobject reference → Definition: product_short_description
       • Attach the metaobject entry to each product as needed.

  BLOCK SETTINGS EXPECTED (for fallback + styles):
    - is_show (checkbox)            → used only if metaobject value missing
    - description (text)            → fallback text if metaobject missing/blank
    - font_size (number, px)
    - padding_top/right/bottom/left (numbers, px)

  BEHAVIOR:
    - is_show resolution:
        prefer metaobject.settings.is_show (or typed field), else block.settings.is_show,
        else defaults to TRUE (component shows).
      ⚠ Liquid note: "default" treats false as blank. This code preserves explicit false via checks.
    - description resolution:
        prefer metaobject.settings.description (or typed field), else block.settings.description, else ''.

  TROUBLESHOOTING:
    - If nothing renders, ensure the product metafield actually points to a metaobject entry.
    - If using typed metaobject fields, update accessors as noted above (no `.value.` on the JSON path).
    - "nil" vs "null": Liquid uses `nil`. JSON `null` becomes `nil` after parsing.
    - If you later switch to parsing JSON in Liquid with `| parse_json` and get a Theme Check warning,
      it’s just the linter; Shopify runtime supports it.

  EXAMPLE VALUES:
    Metaobject "settings" JSON:
      {"is_show":true,"description":"{count} happy pets chose this in the last 30 days."}
    Block settings (fallback):
      is_show: true
      description: "Soft, breathable, and easy to clean."

  USAGE:
    - Add a block of type "bah-product-short-des" to your product section.
    - Attach the "product_short_description" metaobject to the product metafield
      custom.product_short_description. The component will auto-render.
  
  Sample JSON (put this into your metafield value)
  ---------------
  {
    "is_show": true,
    "description": "A smart, USB-rechargeable motion ball that rolls and bounces automatically — keeping your dog or cat active, entertained, and happy all day long."
  }
{%- endcomment -%}

{% for block in section.blocks %}
  {% case block.type %}
    {% when 'bah-product-short-des' %}
      {%- assign short_description_mo = null -%}
{{ product.metafields.custom.product_short_description }}
      {%- assign mf = product.metafields.custom.product_short_description -%}
      {%- if mf != blank -%}
        {%- if mf.type contains 'metaobject' -%}
          {%- assign short_description_mo = mf.value -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Normalize into variables {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign is_show = true -%}
      {%- assign short_description = '' -%}

      {%- if short_description_mo -%}
        {%- assign cfg = mf.value.json_shema | default: mf.json_shema | default: mf.value | default: mf -%}

        {%- assign is_show = cfg.value.is_show -%}
        {%- if is_show == null -%}
          {%- assign is_show = block.settings.is_show -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if is_show != true and is_show != false and is_show != null -%}
          {%- assign v = is_show | downcase | strip -%}
          {%- if v == 'true' or v == '1' or v == 'yes' or v == 'y' -%}
            {%- assign is_show = true -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign is_show = false -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- assign short_description = cfg.value.description -%}
        {%- if short_description == null or short_description == '' -%}
          {%- assign short_description = block.settings.description | default: '' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if is_show -%}
        <div
          class="short-description"
          style="
            font-size: {{ block.settings.font_size | default: 16 }}px;
            padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top   | default: 10 }}px
                     {{ block.settings.padding_right | default: 0 }}px
                     {{ block.settings.padding_bottom| default: 10 }}px
                     {{ block.settings.padding_left  | default: 0 }}px;
          "
        >
          <span>
            {{ short_description }}
          </span>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
  {% endcase %}
{% endfor %}
